---
import ArrowIcon from "../../components/ArrowIcon.astro";
import ServiceOffers from "../../components/ServiceOffers.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="pH7Builder services and pricing"
  description="Build independently for free or work directly with pH7Builder creator Pierre-Henry Soria on a focused launch, custom dating product or ongoing engineering."
  path="/services/"
>
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Build it yourself or work with the creator</p>
    <h1>Choose the help your dating product actually needs.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The software and blueprint tool stay free. Professional work is available when your launch, migration or product-specific rules need direct engineering attention.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="/build/">Create your product blueprint<ArrowIcon /></a>
      <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}?subject=pH7Builder%20project`}>Discuss a project<ArrowIcon /></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section surface" aria-labelledby="service-options-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Four ways to move</p>
          <h2 id="service-options-title">Start free. Add help only where it matters.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>All professional prices are starting points in USD. Final scope, availability, responsibilities and third-party costs are agreed before work begins.</p>
      </div>
      <ServiceOffers />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Established products and prototypes</p>
        <h2>Useful help is not limited to a fresh pH7Builder installation.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Existing software deserves an honest technical assessment before anyone promises a migration, rewrite or production launch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-paths">
      <article>
        <span>AI prototype</span>
        <h3>Take an AI-built dating app from prototype to production.</h3>
        <p>Review authentication, data access, matching, messaging, payments, moderation, deployment and operating costs. Preserve useful work instead of assuming the application must be rebuilt.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/services/ai-prototype-to-production/">Review this service<ArrowIcon /></a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Existing platform</span>
        <h3>Plan a dating-platform migration without gambling with member data.</h3>
        <p>Map the current schema, custom behaviour, privacy obligations and operational dependencies before selecting a migration path.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/services/migration/">Review migration support<ArrowIcon /></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight narrow-shell contact-brief">
    <p class="eyebrow">A useful first message</p>
    <h2>Send the idea, current state and desired outcome.</h2>
    <p>Include the application or repository you already have, the audience, the decision or problem blocking progress, and an approximate USD budget. Sensitive credentials and member data do not belong in the first email.</p>
    <a class="button" href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}?subject=pH7Builder%20project%20enquiry`}>Email {site.contactEmail}<ArrowIcon /></a>
    <p class="contact-note">This is a direct email link, not a form pretending to submit somewhere.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .service-paths { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .service-paths article { display: flex; min-height: 26rem; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--paper-strong); }
  .service-paths span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .service-paths h3 { max-width: 18ch; margin-top: auto; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); }
  .service-paths p { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .service-paths a { width: fit-content; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .contact-brief { padding-inline: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--lime); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .contact-brief h2 { max-width: 15ch; }
  .contact-brief .button { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .contact-note { margin: 0.8rem 0 0; font-size: 0.82rem; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .service-paths { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .service-paths article { min-height: 0; } }
</style>
